{"kind":"rss","id":"wxmp:channel:gh_8d7f6ed4daff","title":"leveryd","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkyMDIxMjE5MA==&mid=2247485491&idx=1&sn=9e4d62e3c2d058cba9fa930fd49aa2b7&chksm=c046b95f4d904661a4834f21ce63c42f23d9184576906bdbda713b024f3e27bb5aac34a0befd&scene=126&sessionid=1795732217#rd","description":"这里分享关于WAF、主机安全等安全产品的知识，欢迎与我交流","language":"zh-cn","extra":{"view":"timeline","show_thumbnails":true,"proxy_images":true,"headers":{"referer":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"tags":["微信公众号"]},"author":{"name":"leveryd","uri":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx.qlogo.cn%2Fmmhead%2FQ3auHgzwzM4IARCacywSfZaHygV4sjPbU3NicE6TPA8euKdMvLVRYfQ%2F0","updated":"2025-01-10T09:31:12.000Z","items":[{"id":"wxmp:MzkyMDIxMjE5MA%3D%3D:2247485491:1","title":"没想到x-waf还可以用来测rasp","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkyMDIxMjE5MA==&mid=2247485491&idx=1&sn=9e4d62e3c2d058cba9fa930fd49aa2b7&chksm=c046b95f4d904661a4834f21ce63c42f23d9184576906bdbda713b024f3e27bb5aac34a0befd&scene=126&sessionid=1795732217#rd","description":"今天研发rasp的师傅使用x-waf工具发现了产品上的sql注入的绕过case，完成修复后再使用x-waf复测通过。\n\n我没想到，用户比作者更懂使用场景。我本来说x-waf就是用来做waf防护能力测试的，没想到rasp研发时也能用来做测试。\n\n过程中我也发现x-waf从下载到使用过程中会有一些明显的障碍、bug，我也做了一些优化。\n\n希望大家可以向我反馈使用上的bug、讨论fuzz时的payload变异策略，无论是issue还是微信群里。\n\n项目地址是 https://github.com/leveryd/x-waf","content":"<p>今天研发rasp的师傅使用x-waf工具发现了产品上的sql注入的绕过case，完成修复后再使用x-waf复测通过。<br /><br />我没想到，用户比作者更懂使用场景。我本来说x-waf就是用来做waf防护能力测试的，没想到rasp研发时也能用来做测试。<br /><br />过程中我也发现x-waf从下载到使用过程中会有一些明显的障碍、bug，我也做了一些优化。<br /><br />希望大家可以向我反馈使用上的bug、讨论fuzz时的payload变异策略，无论是issue还是微信群里。<br /><br />项目地址是 https://github.com/leveryd/x-waf</p>\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FFwyeCXsWiaYx18BqgicMtT52vic12icw8Aj1yFV9A8ibv5sAzyZXrHHB6Oribxiaa3MOXXicuKCnkoTDorMjaia1F4UyE3g%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_